# UI/UX · Audit · Dashboard (LOCKED)

Full text: `docs/04-uiux-audit-dashboard-rules.md`

## Before changes
Inspect existing code/UI first. Audit AI Studio code for bugs, dupes, unused imports, security, tenant leaks, stale cache. Fix mistakes — do not rewrite working features.

## Branding
Remove unnecessary AI Studio / Gemini / demo / placeholder branding. Keep verified legal attributions. Product brand = Unityteck SaaS.

## UI
`designs/` (+ Drive) = primary reference. If UI already matches → **do not touch**. Fix only missing / broken / clearly different screens.

## Data pages
Reusable advanced tables: search, pagination, page size, sort, filters (date/status/…), bulk where needed, loading/empty/error, responsive.

## Analytics
Date ranges: today / yesterday / week / month / custom. Keep **order source** ≠ **traffic source**. No fake attribution — use Unknown/Direct when unsure.

## Settings
Modular sections (branding, payments, SEO, Google, team, domain, hosting, …) — not one dump page.

## Updates
No unnecessary full refresh; invalidate cache so old data/images never show.
